{"kind":"pr","url":"https://github.com/aliqasemzadeh/crm/pull/1","repo":"aliqasemzadeh/crm","number":1,"set":"agent","source":"cursor","title":"Add AGENTS.md with Cursor Cloud development environment instructions","body":"<!-- CURSOR_AGENT_PR_BODY_BEGIN -->\n## Summary\nAdds `AGENTS.md` with Cursor Cloud-specific development environment instructions for future agents.\n\n## What's included\n- Project overview and tech stack summary\n- Prerequisites (PHP 8.4, Composer, Node.js 22)\n- Flux UI Pro license setup (uses `FLUX_LICENSE_EMAIL` and `FLUX_LICENSE_KEY` secrets, with stub fallback)\n- Locale configuration (`APP_LOCALE=fa` for Farsi RTL)\n- Dev server startup instructions (`composer dev` or individual tmux sessions)\n- Database setup (SQLite default, VoIP migration caveats)\n- Test and lint commands\n- External service notes (Sepidar, Issabel, Bale, SMS)\n\n## Demo: Login flow with real Flux UI Pro\n[demo_login_flux_pro.mp4](https://cursor.com/agents/bc-eb927d9b-cc44-4cec-bb2b-ff20bdfd8d8c/artifacts?path=%2Fopt%2Fcursor%2Fartifacts%2Fdemo_login_flux_pro.mp4)\n\n[Login page with Flux UI Pro styling and Farsi translations](https://cursor.com/agents/bc-eb927d9b-cc44-4cec-bb2b-ff20bdfd8d8c/artifacts?path=%2Fopt%2Fcursor%2Fartifacts%2Flogin_page_flux_pro.webp)\n[Dashboard after authentication](https://cursor.com/agents/bc-eb927d9b-cc44-4cec-bb2b-ff20bdfd8d8c/artifacts?path=%2Fopt%2Fcursor%2Fartifacts%2Fdashboard_flux_pro.webp)\n\n## Environment setup verified\n- PHP 8.4.21, Composer 2.9.7, Node.js 22.22.2\n- `composer install` with real Flux UI Pro package\n- `npm install`\n- SQLite database with migrations\n- `php artisan test` (1 pass, 1 pre-existing failure)\n- `./vendor/bin/pint --test` (runs successfully, pre-existing style issues)\n- Dev servers (artisan serve + vite) both running\n- Login flow tested end-to-end with Farsi locale\n\n<sub>To show artifacts inline, <a href=\"https://cursor.com/dashboard/cloud-agents#my-pull-requests\">enable</a> in settings.</sub>